WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.719 --> 00:00:08.875
Each teaching week opens a different interactive world. The navigation stays the same; the encounter does not repeat.

2
00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:19.882
Pick a week and enter. The experience opens over the page, and nothing behind it is lost. If you have been in before, the button reads Re-enter and you resume where you left off.

3
00:00:19.882 --> 00:00:30.885
Press Enter the experience, then move chapter by chapter. Use Previous and Next, the chapter dots, the arrow keys, or a swipe on a touch screen. The bar at the top shows your progress.

4
00:00:30.885 --> 00:00:41.887
Do what the world asks. Chapters invite you to choose, sort, open, and weigh things, including opening both eyes on a Two-Eyed Seeing frame. Take the invitations; they are the teaching.

5
00:00:41.887 --> 00:00:49.867
Adjust the text if you need to. The A minus and A plus controls resize the experience text, and Reset restores it.

6
00:00:49.867 --> 00:01:00.869
Leave any time; return any time. The X button or the Escape key closes the experience and returns you to the page you came from. Start again restarts the week from the top.

7
00:01:00.869 --> 00:01:05.304
Experiences are teaching, not testing. Nothing is scored.

8
00:01:05.304 --> 00:01:11.538
Where next: After an experience, open the same week's Study Guide to lock the idea in.
